  "Type /move to open or close the window. Type /move FrameName to move a frame by its name. Type /move pick to pick a frame on the screen. Type /move hide FrameName to hide or show a frame. Type /move done to stop moving all frames. Type /unmove FrameName to put a frame back where the game puts it. Type /move key <key> to set a key for the window. Type /movelist to see the saved layouts, /movecopy Name to copy one and /movedelete Name to delete one.": "Команды: /move (окно), /move FrameName (переместить), /move pick (выбрать), /move hide FrameName (скрыть/показать), /move done (готово), /unmove FrameName (сброс), /move key <key> (клавиша), /movelist (список), /movecopy Name (копировать), /movedelete Name (удалить).",
